id.instance: String (TS "c<n>")
num.game: i32
num.cursor: u32
map.ordered: IndexMap
bag.data: IndexMap<String, serde_json::Value>
error.style: Result<_, EngineError> with TS's message; panic only on invariants (fixture helpers panic with TS's thrown text)
null.optional: Option + skip_serializing_if
null.nullable: Option, serialised null
case.json: camelCase via serde rename_all
case.rust: snake_case
state.mut: &mut GameState writes, &GameState reads, &mut EngineSink for TS sink mutators
rng.source: Rng::new(&state.seed, state.rng_cursor) and write the cursor back
hook.style: Arc<dyn Fn + Send + Sync> via hook()/read_hook()/aura_hook()/target_check(); one fn item coerced to Arc for CastEachArgs.cards; no fn pointers
registry.style: OnceLock set once by register_all; tests use the testkit's thread-local override, merged onto registered_catalog()/registered_scripts()
async.style: tokio in crates/server only; none in pure crates
log.style: tracing JSON to stdout, server only
fixture.exports: lowercase TS value consts as zero-arg fns; UPPER TS consts as pub const / pub static LazyLock of the same name (plus fn aliases for *_SCRIPTS/*_DEFS); catalog() and scripts() per file
fixture.nonce: thread_local Cell<u32> per file
